&lt;h3 data-hextra-search-id="have-stow-create-the-symbolic-links"&gt;Have stow create the symbolic links&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="have-stow-create-the-symbolic-links"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#have-stow-create-the-symbolic-links" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Now, from the &lt;code&gt;~/dotfiles&lt;/code&gt; directory, run &lt;code&gt;stow &amp;lt;directory_name&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;, for example, &lt;code&gt;stow zsh&lt;/code&gt; for &lt;code&gt;.zshrc&lt;/code&gt;. Stow will automatically create a symbolic link to &lt;code&gt;~/.zshrc&lt;/code&gt; from &lt;code&gt;~/dotfiles/.zshrc&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;cd&lt;/span&gt; ~/dotfiles
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;stow zsh
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;stow p10k
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;stow tmux&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
