&lt;h3 data-hextra-search-id="add-files-and-directories-to-stow-local-ignore-and-stow-global-ignore"&gt;Add files and directories to &lt;code&gt;.stow-local-ignore&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;.stow-global-ignore&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="add-files-and-directories-to-stow-local-ignore-and-stow-global-ignore"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#add-files-and-directories-to-stow-local-ignore-and-stow-global-ignore" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class="hx:overflow-x-auto hx:mt-6 hx:flex hx:rounded-sm hx:border hx:py-2 hx:ltr:pr-4 hx:rtl:pl-4 hx:contrast-more:border-current hx:contrast-more:dark:border-current hx:border-green-400 hx:bg-green-50 hx:text-green-700 hx:dark:border-green-500/70 hx:dark:bg-green-950/60 hx:dark:text-green-400"&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:ltr:pl-3 hx:ltr:pr-2 hx:rtl:pr-3 hx:rtl:pl-2"&gt;&lt;div class="hx:select-none hx:text-xl" style="font-family: 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol';"&gt;❓&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:w-full hx:min-w-0 hx:leading-7"&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:mt-6 hx:leading-7 hx:first:mt-0"&gt;Add any files or directories that you want to ignore in the &lt;code&gt;.stow-local-ignore&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;.stow-global-ignore&lt;/code&gt; files. For example, you can add &lt;code&gt;.git&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;.stow-local-ignore&lt;/code&gt; so that stow ignores the git directory.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;.stow-local-ignore&lt;/code&gt; file is like a &lt;code&gt;.gitignore&lt;/code&gt; file for stow. &lt;code&gt;.stow-local-ignore&lt;/code&gt; ignores per package (directory) and &lt;code&gt;.stow-global-ignore&lt;/code&gt; ignores files and directories globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will add &lt;code&gt;.git&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;.stow-local-ignore&lt;/code&gt; so the stow ignores that directory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-markdown" data-lang="markdown"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;.git
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;.gitignore&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
